ook for any existing \"related\" or \"backlink\" UI.\n\nReturn a concise structured report with: the exact primitive names/shapes, file:line citations, whether app-owned objects can be morph targets, and any constraints (install order, validation) you find. Be specific and quote real symbols. Do NOT write code."
